factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  Reel script says 'இதையடுத்து' (following this) linking the two-judge bench order to the non-lighting; article says the bench ordered lighting after the earlier order, so the causal framing is not clearly supported
  Reel script says the bench 'இந்த உத்தரவை பிறப்பித்தது' referring to the non-lighting context, mixing the court's order with the non-compliance in one sentence, which muddles the facts
  Reel script and slides say the celebration (fireworks) and the lamp-lighting took place at the 'அர்த்தநாரீஸ்வர் மலைக்கோவில் அடிவாரத்தில', but the article places the fireworks and lamps at the Arumuga Swamy temple in front of the hill foot; the location of the fireworks is not stated as the hill foot in the article
  Caption says 'இந்நிலையில் இரண்டு நீதிபதிகள் கொண்ட தனிக்குழு தீபம் ஏற்ற வேண்டும் என உத்தரவிட்டது' and the reel says the bench order came after non-compliance; the article does not state that the bench order came as a response to non-compliance, so the sequence is an invented causal link
  Slide 'யார்' lists 'நிர்வாகிகள் மற்றும் மகளிர் அணியினர் பங்கேற்பு' which is accurate, but the reel script omits the fact that the event was described as a devotees' victory being celebrated, which is present in the article as the reason for the fireworks; minor, but the reel's 'இது பக்தர்களின் வெற்றி என்று கூறி' is accurate, so no issue here
